@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@hrAccessToken = paste_hr_access_token_locally
@departmentId = 1
@positionId = 1

### HR lists departments (ADMIN/EMPLOYEE must receive 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments?q=engine&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{hrAccessToken}}

### HR creates department; code is optional and generated when absent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{hrAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Engineering","description":null}

### HR updates department
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hrAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Technology","description":"Updated department"}

### HR creates position; aliases title/level are also accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{hrAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Engineer","jobLevel":"Senior","description":null}

### HR updates position
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/positions/{{positionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hrAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jobLevel":"Lead"}
